{"4831490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ChessBox", "steam_appid": 4831490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessBox is a unique game where you can beat your opponent on the ring and outsmart them on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Brains or brawn? In ChessBox, one will win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME RULES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Minutes of Boxing.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Minutes of Chess.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat again and again.  </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First person to KO or Checkmate the opponent wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple as that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is multiplayer (Online or LAN) and allows players to create/join lobbies, find games quickly via a matchmaker, as well as spectate live matches.  <br><br><u>Note</u>: Controller support, Linux support, MacOS support, Steam Achievements as well as other languages will be added  before release.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessBox is a unique game where you can beat your opponent on the ring and outsmart them on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Brains or brawn? In ChessBox, one will win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME RULES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Minutes of Boxing.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Minutes of Chess.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat again and again.  </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First person to KO or Checkmate the opponent wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple as that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is multiplayer (Online or LAN) and allows players to create/join lobbies, find games quickly via a matchmaker, as well as spectate live matches.  <br><br><u>Note</u>: Controller support, Linux support, MacOS support, Steam Achievements as well as other languages will be added  before release.</p>", "short_description": "The match alternates between 2 minutes of chess and 2 minutes of boxing. First to KO or Checkmate the opponent wins. Brains or brawn? In ChessBox, one will win.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831490/0303eef577f00f1dcdb4b6d32d5a5dd241154129/header.jpg?t=1787607147", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831490/6301b34b8941021773dcd14070cbed620679859d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787607147", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831490/6301b34b8941021773dcd14070cbed620679859d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787607147", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 / i5-2400 or Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti / GTX 950 / RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / GTX 1660 / RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum"